msgstr "使用此代碼作為購買限制商品之許可而購買的 WooCommerce 訂單編號。"

#: sasoEventtickets_Core.php:368
msgid "WooCommerce product id that was restricted with this code."
msgstr "使用此代碼進行限制的 WooCommerce 產品編號。"

#: sasoEventtickets_Core.php:369
msgid "Creation date of the WooCommerce purchase using the allowance code."
msgstr "使用授權碼之 WooCommerce 購買的建立日期。"

#: sasoEventtickets_Core.php:370
msgid ""
"Creation date timezone of the WooCommerce purchase using the allowance code."
msgstr "使用授權碼之 WooCommerce 購買的建立日期時區。"

#: sasoEventtickets_Core.php:371
msgid "The public ticket number"
msgstr "公開的票券編號"

#: sasoEventtickets_Core.php:1401
msgid ""
"No writable temporary directory is available for the ticket PDF. Please "
"define WP_TEMP_DIR in wp-config.php or ask your host to make the temporary "
"directory writable."
msgstr ""

#: sasoEventtickets_Core.php:1419
